356
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,940
Your wealth is distributed among your home's value.

357
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:08,860
Retirement accounts and an investment portfolio.

358
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:10,420
And maybe real estate or a small business.

359
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:12,420
You have a large emergency fund and strong insurance.

360
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:13,700
And an accountant sorting out taxes.

361
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:15,060
And you might use a financial advisor.

362
00:11:15,060 --> 00:11:16,660
Or follow a clear investment plan.

363
00:11:16,660 --> 00:11:18,260
And the money itself moves automatically.

364
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:19,820
And every month a portion goes to investments.

365
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:21,620
The car is luxury, modern, and paid off.

366
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:23,420
Or has a small loan with low interest.

367
00:11:23,420 --> 00:11:25,220
Your phone breaks, you replace it the same day.

368
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:27,620
You don't need to hold onto something broken for two weeks.

369
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:29,980
Because the cost of fixing it strains your budget.

370
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:30,580
At work.

371
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:31,940
You are at a high level.

372
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:33,660
Managing a team, managing a clinic.

373
00:11:33,660 --> 00:11:35,180
Or you own your own company.

374
00:11:35,180 --> 00:11:36,460
And your schedule is full of meetings.

375
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:38,900
You inherently own a large part of the control over it.

376
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:40,460
You can take a real vacation.

377
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:43,340
And your income doesn't disappear just because you stop working for two days.

378
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:44,380
Healthcare is preventive.

379
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:45,260
Checkups.

380
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,380
Specialist doctors.

381
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:47,340
And you don't wait for the pain.

382
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:49,060
To start taking action. During the day,

383
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:50,220
You approve a home repair.

384
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:51,980
Without comparing twenty price quotes.

385
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:53,460
And book a trip well in advance.

386
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:54,820
You choose a comfortable seat.

387
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:57,380
And can donate to a school or a cause you care about.

388
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,220
If you have kids.

389
00:11:58,220 --> 00:12:00,180
You can keep up with their activities and lessons.

390
00:12:00,180 --> 00:12:01,780
And even a private school if you choose.

391
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:03,340
Or at night, you review your investments.

393
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:06,940
And order a gift without checking your balance.

394
00:12:06,940 --> 00:12:08,480
You plan for next year.

395
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:10,920
Travel, a home renovation, or a new investment.

396
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:12,440
You feel ready for today.

397
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,320
But more importantly.

398
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,600
You have the space to plan for the future.

399
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,600
Conclusion.

400
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,480
And a prayer.

401
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:21,040
In the end, whether you slept on a cold sidewalk.

402
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,240
Or a silk bed.

403
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,200
The result is the same.

404
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,720
Shrouds have no pockets.

405
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,720
We all leave this world the way we came.

406
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,550
