407
00:12:28,550 --> 00:12:29,950
May God bless us and you with contentment.

408
00:12:29,950 --> 00:12:31,190
And blessed, lawful provision.

409
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:32,910
And enrich us with His grace above all others.

410
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:35,110
And place the world in our hands, not in our hearts.

411
00:12:35,110 --> 00:12:36,750
And now, share your thoughts in the comments.